reviews.review:
Honestly speaking, this game can change how you live your life, like completely change it in a good way. A life-changing game; If you struggle with motivation, the systems in this game can be adapted to real life so you can make a schedule accordingly and suddenly you are now living a healthier life. 

Same goes for the social aspect, if you struggle socially like me, the confidants can motivate you to start looking for a close friend or friend group where everyone helps each other out;

Very good
